<!-- SHIP_VERMIN_MOD_1 - RSW_Mynock, our OWN species def (owner ruling,
     2026-09-11: ship our own clone/reskin concept, never an in-place patch
     on a donor mynock — see scarlands_kit_spec.md's owner-rulings section,
     item 3). Species content lives here (RimStarWars tier, "species vs.
     clan" rule in design/NAMING_SCHEME_PLAN.md - a mynock is Star-Wars-
     generic, not Utinni-specific), the boarding/breeding/gnaw MECHANICS
     ride on top via mandrake.rm.shipvermin's own patch
     (ShipVermin/Defs/Patches/RSW_Mynock_ShipVermin.xml) so this def stays a
     pure species definition and SWBestiary never depends on ShipVermin.

     Vacuum-capable per the owner's own framing ("some can live outside in
     vaccuum (the mynock for example)"): canBeVacuumBurnt=false and
     VacuumResistance 1 (both RimSage-verified against
     RaceProperties.canBeVacuumBurnt / Pawn.HarmedByVacuum /
     Pawn.ConcernedByVacuum, both of which gate purely on VacuumResistance)
     mean a mynock standing in hard vacuum takes no VacuumBurn damage and
     never triggers VacuumExposure - no hull, no life support, ever required.
     ComfyTemperature is set to the widest practical range for the same
     reason (space has no comfortable band to speak of).

     Body/stats: bat/leech-sized ship parasite - Bird body (RimSage: closest
     vanilla small-flyer plan) at a fraction of Chicken's bodySize, cheap
     individually (low MarketValue, low Mass) per the owner's "nuisance
     unless there are many" ruling - the MEANNESS is entirely in ShipVermin's
     comps/JobGivers reading population off this def's own instances, not in
     any per-mynock stat inflation here. Wildness kept high (a swarm pest,
     not a pet) but not maxed - "some are cute" leaves room for a future
     tamer-friendly ship-vermin species to undercut this one without a
     structural change.

     Art: GENERATED - RSW_Mynock's own texPath
     (RimStarWars/SWBestiary/ShipVermin/Mynock/Mynock.png, Graphic_Single)
     carries real owner-approved art since 75115178c (2026-09-11): the
     "hideous wet practical-effects" redesign from IKEE_MYNOCK_ART_REGEN_1,
     reused from mandrake.rsw.mynockartoverride's south-facing texture. One
     static graphic, not a directional north/east/south set - the previous
     "NOT YET GENERATED" note above was stale and was corrected during
     MYNOCK_FLIGHT_ART_FIRST_1 (2026-09-20), which confirmed the art before
     touching flight. mandrake.rsw.mynockartoverride's own texture bytes
     (swanimals/Mynock/*) remain unrelated - that mod retextures a different,
     donor mynock at the donor's own texPath.

     Flight (MYNOCK_FLIGHT_ART_FIRST_1, 2026-09-20): MaxFlightTime/
     FlightCooldown/flightStartChanceOnJobStart/flightSpeedFactor/
     canFlyIntoMap match this repo's own house convention across every other
     RSW_ bestiary flyer (Sketto/Shyrack/Convor/Whisperbird etc: 30/10/0.05,
     plus flightSpeedFactor 2.5 per CLAUDE.md's Locust/Chicken shape and
     RUT_PyrelandsFauna's own use) rather than the deleted desert-port
     duplicate's numbers, which were donor intent only, not a spec.
     canLeaveMapFlying is deliberately OMITTED: a mynock lairs on its host
     hull rather than migrating off the map, unlike the wildlife above that
     all set it true. No flyingAnimationFramePathPrefix - no flip-book frames
     exist for this species' own art, so it flies with no wing-beat, which
     is documented correct behaviour (CLAUDE.md, "the flying ANIMATION is
     separate from the flight STAT"), not a thing to block on. -->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RSW_Mynock</defName>
    <label>mynock</label>
    <description>A leathery, wet-winged ship-leech that drifts through vacuum toward any hull with power still running through it. Cheap and quiet alone - a nuisance you barely notice - but they breed fast once a few take hold, and a real infestation will gnaw a ship's conduits and lights dead compartment by compartment. They never need air, warmth, or a roof; they were never built for any of those.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>3.2</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>8</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.03</Mass>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-150</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>150</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <FilthRate>1</FilthRate>
      <Wildness>0.9</Wildness>
      <VacuumResistance>1</VacuumResistance>
      <MaxFlightTime>30</MaxFlightTime>
      <FlightCooldown>10</FlightCooldown>
    </statBases>
    <uiIconScale>0.6</uiIconScale>
    <race>
      <thinkTreeMain>Animal</thinkTreeMain>
      <thinkTreeConstant>AnimalConstant</thinkTreeConstant>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <body>Bird</body>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <canBeVacuumBurnt>false</canBeVacuumBurnt>
      <canFlyInVacuum>true</canFlyInVacuum>
      <flightStartChanceOnJobStart>0.05</flightStartChanceOnJobStart>
      <flightSpeedFactor>2.5</flightSpeedFactor>
      <canFlyIntoMap>true</canFlyIntoMap>
      <baseBodySize>0.12</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.25</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.2</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>OmnivoreAnimal</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Plain</leatherDef>
      <meatLabel>mynock meat</meatLabel>
      <roamMtbDays>2</roamMtbDays>
      <lifeExpectancy>4</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBabyTiny</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.15</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.3</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Squirrel_Call</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Squirrel_Call</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Squirrel_Call</soundCall>
          <soundAngry>Pawn_Squirrel_Call</soundAngry>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
    </race>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>fanged mouth</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.6</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Beak</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <graphicData>
      <!-- placeholder path, no art yet - see file header. -->
      <texPath>RimStarWars/SWBestiary/ShipVermin/Mynock/Mynock</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.6</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <useHitPoints>false</useHitPoints>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
